{
  "id": 2090,
  "name": "parasol-pick",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "パラソル部分が　持ちにくいという評判もあり　指は　汚れてしまうが食べたあとに　くるくる回すと　楽しい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "파라솔 부분이 집기 힘들다는 평가도 있다. 손가락이 더러워지지만 다 먹고 나서 빙글빙글 돌리면 재미있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "雖然有些人詬病陽傘部分不易拿取，而且手還會沾到食物，不過吃完後可以拿來轉著玩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Certains se plaignent que le parasol rend le Sandwich difficile à manger, et que l’on finit par se salir les doigts. Mais c’est amusant de le faire tourner après avoir fini.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Einige finden, dass das Schirmchen stört und beim Essen zu schmutzigen Fingern führt. Aber dafür macht es Spaß, den Pikser nach dem Essen herumzuzwirbeln.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hay gente que opina que la parte de la sombrilla es incómoda de agarrar y se acaba siempre con los dedos pringados, pero resulta muy divertido darle vueltas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "C’è chi si lamenta che la parte a ombrello non offra una buona presa, ma anche se si finisce per sporcarsi le dita, dopo mangiato ci si può divertire a farlo ruotare.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Some complain that the parasol part of this pick is hard to hold on to, so your fingers get messy. Still, it’s fun to twirl this all around after you’ve eaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "パラソル部分が　持ちにくいという評判もあり　指は　汚れてしまうが食べたあとに　くるくる回すと　楽しい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然有人批评伞的部分不易拿且会弄脏手，但餐后能用来转着玩，很有趣。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hay gente que opina que la parte de la sombrilla es incómoda de agarrar y se acaba siempre con los dedos pringados, pero resulta muy divertido darle vueltas.",
